<title>USA: Sirrom Capital sets $0.32/shr qtly div.</title>
<headline>Sirrom Capital sets $0.32/shr qtly div.</headline>
<dateline>NASHVILLE, Tenn. 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sirrom Capital Corp said on Monday that it would pay a quarterly dividend of $0.32 per share on November 11, 1996, to shareholders of record on October 25.</p>
<p>The specialty finance company said it intended to distribute at least 90 percent of its net investment income and net short-term capital gains to shareholders on a quarterly basis.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
